{"seq":7,"slug":"interaction-design","title":"交互设计","stage":"DONE","category":"design-thinking","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 交互设计\n\n交互设计（Interaction Design，IxD）是设计思维体系中连接\"人的需求\"与\"产品行为\"的桥梁。如果说设计研究回答\"用户需要什么\"、创意构思回答\"可以做什么\"，那么交互设计回答的是\"用户如何与它互动\"——每一次点击、滑动、输入、等待，都是一段对话。\n\n本 hub 在设计思维分类中的定位：聚焦于数字产品中人与系统之间的**行为对话**，覆盖从理论原则到评估迭代的完整链路。兄弟 hub 各有分工——「设计思维基础」讲设计思维的哲学框架与流程，「创意构思与原型制作」侧重发散与快速成型，「人本设计」深入用户研究方法论，「设计研究」提供研究技术工具箱，「系统化设计」关注大规模设计系统的治理，「服务设计」拓展到跨触点的全旅程体验。本 hub 不重复这些内容，而是专注于交互本身的**结构、模式与质量**。\n\n四条主线按\"理论→模式→细节→验证\"递进：**基础原理**建立交互设计的理论地基（核心原则、心智模型、反馈机制）；**界面模式**展开经典交互模式的设计要点（导航、表单、状态）；**动效与微交互**深入时间维度上的细节设计（动效原则、微交互模式、手势空间）；**评估与迭代**提供验证与改进的方法论（可用性测试、启发式评估、A/B 测试）。\n\n学习路径建议：初学者按章节顺序通读，先建立原则框架再掌握具体模式；有经验的设计师可直接跳到「评估与迭代」获取方法论工具，或在「动效与微交互」中寻找可立即应用的细节模式。阅读本 hub 不需要编程背景，但了解基本的用户体验概念和设计思维流程会有所帮助。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-principles","title":"交互设计核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/core-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-mental-models","title":"用户心智模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/user-mental-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-response","title":"反馈与响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/feedback-response"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interface-patterns","title":"界面模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/interface-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"navigation-ia","title":"导航与信息架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/interface-patterns/navigation-ia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"forms-input","title":"表单与输入设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/interface-patterns/forms-input"},{"seq":3,"slug":"states-transitions","title":"状态与过渡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/interface-patterns/states-transitions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"motion-micro","title":"动效与微交互","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motion-principles","title":"动效设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/motion-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"micro-interaction-patterns","title":"微交互模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/micro-interaction-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gesture-spatial","title":"手势与空间交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/gesture-spatial"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation","title":"评估与迭代","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usability-testing","title":"可用性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/evaluation/usability-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heuristic-evaluation","title":"启发式评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/evaluation/heuristic-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ab-testing-iteration","title":"A/B 测试与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/evaluation/ab-testing-iteration"}]}]}